stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OnboardingIncomplete
    OnboardingIncomplete --> NotificationsGranted: Allow POST_NOTIFICATIONS
    NotificationsGranted --> BackgroundAllowed: Allow background access
    BackgroundAllowed --> Ready: Allow notification listener

    Ready --> RulesEmpty: no rules
    RulesEmpty --> BuilderIncomplete: Create rule
    BuilderIncomplete --> BuilderFiltered: apply content filter
    BuilderFiltered --> BuilderInvalid: Save without selected action
    BuilderInvalid --> BuilderComplete: choose action
    BuilderComplete --> RuleEnabled: Save rule
    RuleEnabled --> RuleDisabled: toggle off
    RuleDisabled --> RuleEnabled: toggle on
    RuleDisabled --> RuleDisabled: background/resume or force-stop/relaunch

    Ready --> HistoryEmpty: no captured notifications
    HistoryEmpty --> HistoryPopulated: notification-listener receives notification
    HistoryPopulated --> HistoryFilteredEmpty: rule-triggered or dismissed filter excludes record
    HistoryPopulated --> ActivityNoRules: View activity
    ActivityNoRules --> Changes: select Changes tab

    Ready --> ExploreTop
    ExploreTop --> ExploreSuggestions: scroll
    ExploreSuggestions --> BuilderComplete: Add to my rules
